<p><strong>GTM Instructions:</strong></p>
<ol>
<li><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">Regarding GTM URLS, If the incomi=
ng connection is coming from Onprem then env name should not be mentioned i=
n the namespace of the below mentioned URLs.</span></li>
<li><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);"><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,7=
7);">For any new clients connecting from onprem or Azure to IDGraph GTM clu=
ster , the infra team of those clients needs</span></span> to <span><span c=
lass=3D"ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab =
ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak">onboard IDgraph in their IDP-GTM configs . Sample =
dependency - &nbsp;<a href=3D"https://itrack.web.att.com/browse/SPTINFRENG-=
49076" class=3D"external-link" rel=3D"nofollow">https://itrack.web.att.com/=
browse/SPTINFRENG-49076</a></span></span></li>
</ol>
